.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "../include/myfilefunctions.h"
.PP
.B int wordCount(FILE *file, int *lines, int *words, int *chars);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wordCount
counts the number of lines, words, and characters in the file
.BR file .
The results are stored in the variables pointed to by
.BR lines ,
.BR words ,
and
.BR chars .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the result of the counting operation.
.SH AUTHOR
Mujtaba Raza
